        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS**\r\n\r\nDoran Estates are delighted to present this excellent three-bedroom end-of-terrace property to the rental market, ideally tucked away in the peaceful and well-established Willington Park development in Dublin 6W.\r\n\r\nInternally, the property offers bright and spacious accommodation throughout. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a generous living room with fireplace, guest WC and a fully fitted kitchen.\r\nUpstairs, there are two bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, a study/office and the main family bathroom. The converted attic provides a versatile third room, offering additional space. \r\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a fully enclosed, low-maintenance private garden with a timber decking area. The west-facing orientation provides excellent afternoon and evening sunshine, making it an ideal space to enjoy the longer summer evenings.\r\nThe property enjoys a highly convenient location, with a wide range of amenities within easy reach. Rathfarnham Shopping Centre, Terenure Village and Templeogue Village are all close by, while a number of well-regarded schools and local services are also within the surrounding area. For those who enjoy outdoor and sporting activities, Bushy Park, Templeogue Tennis Club, Templeogue United FC, Spawell Golf Centre and St Jude’s/Faughs GAA clubs are all nearby.\r\n\r\nThe location is also well served by public transport, with several bus routes providing regular connections to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The M50 motorway is less than five minutes away by car, providing convenient access to the wider Dublin area.\r\nWith its generous accommodation, private rear garden and excellent location close to Terenure, Templeogue and Rathfarnham, this property offers a well-connected home in a popular Dublin 6W setting.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended."
      },
